WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
so much

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,060
According to the situation you said

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,860
Then how did you come back?

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,780
What about those people whose towers are still intact?

5
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,860
Of course we are at least back

6
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:12,010
As for those people you mentioned are outside?

7
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:32,790
Commander Zhao, can you go and see the two bodies of Li Dou and Xue Bing?

8
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,310
It's from those two innate dancers

9
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:39,730
If Commander Zhao doesn't believe it, you can check the records from last night.

10
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:42,750
It's those acquired dancers who are left with those enemies

11
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,910
I won't give it to you and just treat it as a discount.

12
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:50,820
Just give it to me based on the military exploits of ordinary soldiers. There are also some cattle and sheep.

13
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,340
You can throw the completion resources to me and give you a slap in the face.
